    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akagambira Musa ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ogambire Abaisiraeli bakuhe enkoni 12 z'enganda zona, buli mukuru w'oruganda akuhe eye. Buli nkoni y'omukuru w'oruganda ogihandikeho eibaralye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ey'oruganda rwa Levi ogihandikeho eibara lya Aroni. Buli ruganda rugiire enkoni emoi, mara ebe ya mukuru warwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma oziteke omw'Ihema ly'Omuterano omu maisho g'ekiikaro, mbali nteranira naiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu owo ndaronda, enkoniye erashebuka, aho Abaisiraeli nyije mbachwe okukujojobera okwo bakujojobera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa agambira Abaisiraeli, buli mukuru w'oruganda amuha enkoniye, zona hamoi nkoni 12. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aziteka omw'Ihema ly'Omuterano omu maisho g'ekiikaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeire Musa kutaha omw'Ihema ly'Omuterano, ashanga enkoni ya Aroni, niyo y'oruganda rwa Levi, eshebukire, eina obututu n'orwakyo, eina n'ebiraba bihisize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwata enkoni ezo azihya aha kiikaro, azitwalira Abaisiraeli. Buli muntu aihaho enkoni eye, aleba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira Musa kugarura enkoni ya Aroni aha kiikaro, abashengi kabata nibaijukiraho, bakalekera kumushenga n'okumujojobera, batalija bakafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akora atyo, nk'okwo Omukama yabaire amuhangiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli bagambira Musa bati, “Twafa, twahwaho, twahwaho ichwena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuraba kuli buli ayagoba aha kiikaro ky'Omukama ni kufa, rwona turafa. Tufe ichwena?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
